  "content": "<p>鞘翅槽（Elytra Slot）是一款模组，利用Curios API/Trinkets API在玩家物品栏中添加一个鞘翅专用槽位，并允许将鞘翅放入其中。当鞘翅位于该槽位时，它将提供与胸甲槽位中相同的飞行能力。这让玩家既能享受鞘翅的飞行优势，又无需牺牲护甲槽位。</p><h3>Forge 依赖</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caelus</a></li>\n</ul><h3>Fabric 依赖</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Curios</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gFyQBPW.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h3><strong>Trinkets</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FVV3gSp/elytratrinket.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>下载</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot-fabric/files/all\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric 1.16.1 - 1.19.2</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric 1.19.3+</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9153\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Quilt</strong></a></li>\n</ul><h2>支持</h2><p>请将所有漏洞、问题和功能请求报告至\n<a href=\"https://github.com/illusivesoulworks/elytraslot/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a>。</p><p>如需非技术支持与疑问解答，请加入开发者的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JWgrdwt\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。</p><h2>许可</h2><p>所有源代码和资源均采用LGPL-3.0或更高版本许可。</p><h2>捐赠</h2><p>开发者可通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fC0C1NL4O\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a> 接收捐赠。</p><h2>合作伙伴</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fillusive\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/1G4QPdc/bh-illusive.png\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p>",
